OL,3,GNEWSAAid volunteer moved by stories
OL,4,Afrom Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer who recently delivered aid
OL,7,Fto Ukraine has spoken about the fears
OL,8,Ffacing young people whose lives have
OL,9,Fbeen shaped by war.
OL,11,FIain Terpening, 60, who owns a cafe in
OL,12,FBottesford, Leicestershire, has
OL,13,Fcompleted his second aid convoy with
OL,14,Fthe charity Pickups for Peace, which
OL,15,Fdelivers vehicles and supplies to
OL,16,Fcommunities across Ukraine.
OL,18,FAmong the experiences that stayed with
OL,19,Fhim was a meeting with two students in
OL,20,Fthe western city of Lviv.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
