OL,3,GNEWSAAid volunteer moved by stories
OL,4,Afrom Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe young men, 21 and 22, spoke about
OL,7,Ftheir ambitions and plans for the
OL,8,Ffuture, but were worried they could one
OL,9,Fday be called up to fight.
